# Build context of the images in infra/docker (compose builds them from the repository root).
# Only paths that no Dockerfile copies are listed, so no image changes. They stay out of the
# context for size (a local Rust build directory can be gigabytes) and so that secrets and local
# data (the CoStar kit, uploads) are never sent to the Docker daemon.
.git
.env
.env.*
.data
apps/backend/target
